    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933830/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1729812702\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933830/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1729812702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933830/extras/e73f3d6dd762c74edd7bb1b3d7dc6a9a.avif?t=1729812702\" width=600 height=350 /></span><br><br>Join the exciting adventure with &quot;Project: Stellar Girls&quot; - a match-3 game. Beautiful girls in stunning costumes, armed with incredible guns, are ready to help you complete the game. Let's embark on this adventure!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933830/extras/60067004dbbdc5f2fa25ffda3e6a2814.avif?t=1729812702\" width=611 height=64 /></span><br><br>In this game, you need to correctly match identical crystals in a row to make them disappear. Your goal is to earn points and unlock new levels. After completing several levels, you'll gain access to beautiful girls in the gallery. <br><br>Collect the required number of points and conquer one level after another together with these lovely and beautiful girls. With each new level, breaking crystals and unlocking girls will become more and more interesting! Enjoy both the engaging game and the charming, hot girls! Many exciting levels with stunning effects await you! This game will captivate you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933830/extras/29774d5f5cf6162c962ad9a53c26c097.avif?t=1729812702\" width=611 height=64 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Incredible visual effects<br></li><li>Progress through levels with the in-game girls<br></li><li>Unlock and collect images<br></li><li>Achieve numerous achievements<br></li><li>Relax with music while playing<br></li><li>Skip any level with just one tap<br></li><li>Enjoy your day with adorable girls!</li></ul>",
